WEBVTT

00:12:58.815 --> 00:13:02.011
AG: Arthur is content
with how his career choices worked out.

00:13:02.035 --> 00:13:03.672
He wants you to walk off the stage

00:13:03.696 --> 00:13:05.560
before you fall off of it.

00:13:05.584 --> 00:13:07.318
I understand where he's coming from,

00:13:07.342 --> 00:13:09.469
but I'd rather see you find your balance,

00:13:09.493 --> 00:13:11.543
or get on a different stage altogether.

00:13:12.925 --> 00:13:16.697
You do have choices
beyond aging out and opting out.

00:13:16.721 --> 00:13:18.571
More on those after the break.

00:13:18.595 --> 00:13:25.236
(Music)

00:13:25.906 --> 00:13:28.451
OK, this is going to be
a different kind of ad.

00:13:28.475 --> 00:13:30.977
I played a personal role
in selecting the sponsors